{{also|dover}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From Latin [[Dubris]], from Brythonic [[Dubrās]] ("the waters"). Compare [[Tauber]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈdəʊvə/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈdoʊvəɹ/|lang=en}}

===Proper noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-proper noun}}

# A major port in [[Kent]], [[England]], the closest point to [[France]].
# The capital of the US [[state]] of [[Delaware]].
# A city in [[Ohio]].

